---
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro'
import { comparison } from '@/data/content'
import { site } from '@/data/site'
---

<Section
  id="difference"
  index="04. 차별성"
  kicker="검증된 인수인계 자동화, 국내 업무 환경에 맞게"
  tinted
>
  <Fragment slot="title">기존 자료만으로 시작하는 <b>인수인계 자동화</b></Fragment>

  <div class="table-wrap reveal">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">구분</th>
          <th scope="col">기존 해외 솔루션</th>
          <th class="col-baton" scope="col">
            <img alt="" src={site.logo} />
            Baton
          </th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          comparison.map((row, index) => (
            <tr class="reveal" style={`--d: ${index + 1}`}>
              <th scope="row">{row.label}</th>
              <td>{row.others}</td>
              <td class="col-baton">{row.baton}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="table-note reveal">
    단순 문서 저장을 넘어, 인수인계 자료 생성부터 후임자 Q&A까지 한 번에 자동화합니다.
  </p>
</Section>

<style>
  .table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 560px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: center;
  }

  th,
  td {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 20px 18px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  tbody tr:last-child th,
  tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  thead th {
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  tbody th {
    color: var(--sub);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  td {
    color: var(--body);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Baton 열을 강조합니다. */
  .col-baton {
    background: var(--blue-faint);
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  thead .col-baton img {
    display: block;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    margin: 0 auto 6px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  tbody tr.reveal {
    transform: translateX(-12px);
  }

  tbody tr.reveal.in {
    transform: none;
  }

  .table-note {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--sub);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
</style>
